          "date": "2026-11-13 12:30:18.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_initialize_objects",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_initialize_objects\n\nAdd lod_init_obj_test, covering lod_initialize_objects(): turning the\non-disk lov_ost_data_v1[] slots of an already-fully-defined striping\ninto the in-core stripe dt_object array.\n\nThe real function instantiates each stripe via lu_object_find_at() on\nthe target's OSD/OSP, which needs a live device underneath. Break that\nsingle call out into a new lod_lookup_stripe_object() in lod_lov.c,\nwith a KUNIT_STATIC_STUB_REDIRECT() like lod_qos_declare_object_on()\nalready has, so a kunit test can redirect it to a canned mock_ost_obj\nper OST (via the existing mock_tgt/mock_ost infrastructure) instead of\nneeding lu_site/device object-cache allocation.\n\nCovers: every slot naming a valid OST, a dummy (all-zero) slot being\nskipped per lovea_slot_is_dummy(), and a slot naming an OST index\noutside the target table failing the whole call.\n\nEXPORT_SYMBOL() lod_initialize_objects() and the new\nlod_lookup_stripe_object() so the loadable test module can call/stub\nthem.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [Augment Code]\nChange-Id: I6e040846a7e29865e8944eb91cbbdc278ffe9d61\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
